<title>BELGIUM: EU to revise Pakistan wheat food aid tender.</title>
<headline>EU to revise Pakistan wheat food aid tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will revise a tender for the export of 12,895 tonnes of soft wheat to Pakistan as food aid, a European Commission official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The official said no date had been set for the new tender, which was necessitated by changes to delivery dates and destinations requested by Pakistan and the World Food Programme, which is distributing the aid.</p>
</text>
